1
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:21,000
Love Always, Santa is a romance, comedy, tv movie
film directed by Brian Herzlinger.

2
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,000
After losing her husband Bradley three years ago on Christmas Day,
Celia Banks never thought she’d fall in love again.

3
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Now, her entire world revolves around taking care of her daughter, Lilly.

4
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Lilly writes a letter to Santa with one wish – for her
mommy to be happy and find love again.

5
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:21,000
Celia, played by Marguerite Moreau.

6
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:36,000
Jake, played by Mike Faiola.

7
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:51,000
Randy, played by Brady Smith.

8
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Hank, played by Robert Jason Black.

9
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:21,000
Lily, played by Isadora Swann.

10
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:36,000
Bethany, played by Meghan Duffy.

11
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Love Always, Santa is a 2016 romantic comedy television film
first broadcast by Hallmark Movies & Mysteries.

12
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
It was written by Brian Herzlinger and Jay Black, directed by
Herzlinger, and produced by MarVista Entertainment.

13
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
The film was set in and partially filmed in Northfield, Minnesota.

14
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
The film explores themes of holiday, anonymous letter, single
mother, ferris wheel, letter to santa claus.

15
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
